\c 6
\s1 The Ark Returned to Israel
\p \v 1 \w When the ark|strong="H727"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w had been|strong="H1961"\w* \w in the land|strong="H7704"\w* \w of the Philistines|strong="H6430"\w* \w seven|strong="H7651"\w* \w months|strong="H2320"\w*, \v 2 \w the Philistines|strong="H6430"\w* \w summoned|strong="H7121"\w* \w the priests|strong="H3548"\w* \w and diviners|strong="H7080"\w*, \w saying|strong="H559"\w*, “\w What|strong="H4100"\w* \w shall we do|strong="H6213"\w* \w with the ark|strong="H727"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*? \w Tell us|strong="H3045"\w* \w how|strong="H4100"\w* \w to send it back|strong="H7971"\w* \w to its place|strong="H4725"\w*.”
