\p \v 4 \w So [Saul] passed|strong="H5674"\w* \w through the hill country|strong="H2022"\w* \w of Ephraim|strong="H669"\w* \w and then through the land|strong="H776"\w* \w of Shalishah|strong="H8031"\w*, \w but they did not|strong="H3808"\w* \w find [the donkeys]|strong="H4672"\w*. \w [He and the servant] went|strong="H5674"\w* \w through the region|strong="H776"\w* \w of Shaalim|strong="H8171"\w*, \w but [they were] not [there]|strong="H369"\w*. \w . . .|strong="H5674"\w* \w Then they went|strong="H5674"\w* \w through the land|strong="H776"\w* \w of Benjamin|strong="H3227"\w*, \w and still they did not|strong="H3808"\w* \w find them|strong="H4672"\w*.
