\p \v 24 \w So the cook|strong="H2876"\w* \w -|strong="H853"\w* \w picked up|strong="H7311"\w* \w the leg|strong="H7785"\w* \w and what was attached to it|strong="H5921"\w* \w and set [it]|strong="H7760"\w* \w before|strong="H6440"\w* \w Saul|strong="H7586"\w*. \w Then Samuel said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w Here is|strong="H2009"\w* \w what was kept back|strong="H7604"\w*. \w [It] was set apart|strong="H7760"\w* \w for you|strong="H6440"\w*. \w Eat|strong="H398"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w it has been kept|strong="H8104"\w* for you \w for this occasion|strong="H4150"\w*, \w from the time I said|strong="H559"\w*, ‘\w I have invited|strong="H7121"\w* \w the people|strong="H5971"\w*.’” \w So Saul|strong="H7586"\w* \w dined|strong="H398"\w* \w with|strong="H5973"\w* \w Samuel|strong="H8050"\w* \w that|strong="H1931"\w* \w day|strong="H3117"\w*.
